<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B><I>Key Patient-Reported Outcome Assessments</I></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B><I>&nbsp;</I></B></P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="width: 26%; border: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 2pt">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>Endpoint</B></P></TD>
