    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; width: 19%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 2pt">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>18 &micro;g/kg q2w</B></P>
