<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; padding-top: 0.75pt; padding-right: 0.75pt; padding-left: 2pt; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><I>1.</I></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-top: 0.75pt; padding-right: 0.75pt; padding-left: 2pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><I>Serious TRAEs: Drug hypersensitivity &ndash; severe; Tonsillitis &ndash; moderate. Both events resolved.</I></FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; padding-top: 0.75pt; padding-right: 0.75pt; padding-left: 2pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><I>2.</I></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-top: 0.75pt; padding-right: 0.75pt; padding-left: 2pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><I>Severe TRAEs (excluding Serious TRAEs):</I>&nbsp;<I>pyrexia (24 &micro;g/kg q2w); two ISRs (24 &micro;g/kg q2w); ISR, chest pain (18 &micro;g/kg q2w). All five events resolved.</I></FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B><I>&nbsp;</I></B></P>

